 <title>Netlist Aware Toolkit - LiveDRC, LivePEX, Import Netlist and Ratsnest</title>
 <doc>Layout tools for the IHP SG13G2 open PDK: LiveDRC runs the PDK DRC every time the layout is saved; LivePEX runs a Magic parasitic extraction (CC, RC or R) from a panel; Import Netlist places an xschem SPICE netlist as SG13G2 PCells named after the SPICE instances, optionally at the schematic positions, and updates w/l from a new netlist; Ratsnest draws connection lines from the selected device or pin to the devices and pins that share a net. Made to run inside the IIC-OSIC-TOOLS container. See the documentation link for requirements and usage.</doc>
